  "goodToKnow": "Der Blickpunkt is the focus of attention: im Blickpunkt (der Öffentlichkeit) stehen, in den Blickpunkt rücken. It also means point of view: von diesem Blickpunkt aus. Related: der Blickwinkel (perspective), das Blickfeld (field of vision). Blickpunkt is also a common name for news programmes and magazines. Plural: die Blickpunkte."
